{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "problem": {
    "id": "oa-goldman-sachs-27",
    "courseId": "gomall",
    "lessonId": "00-overview",
    "title": "Product of the Maximum and Minimum in a Dataset",
    "difficulty": "中等",
    "tags": [
      "OA",
      "Goldman Sachs",
      "数据结构",
      "堆",
      "multiset"
    ],
    "description": "从空 multiset 开始依次处理操作：`push x` 插入一个 x；`pop x` 删除一个当前存在的 x 的单个副本。每次操作后输出当前集合最小值与最大值的乘积；若集合为空，按固定源中 Python、Java、C++ 三份实现一致输出 0。",
    "input": "第一行输入操作数 n，随后 n 行每行输入 `push x` 或 `pop x`。约束：1≤n≤2500，1≤x≤10^9；每个 pop 执行时当前 multiset 中至少有一个 x。本站将 n 限制为 2500，使每次操作输出一个最多 19 位的乘积时，总输出不超过 65536 字节；原题允许 n≤10^5，但题库导入器的单题输出上限为 64 KiB。",
    "output": "每行输出对应操作后的乘积；multiset 为空时输出 0。乘积按 64 位整数计算。",
    "explanation": "重复值按 multiset 处理，pop 只移除一个副本；这些行为与固定源中的三种语言参考实现一致。",
    "hints": [
      "使用最小堆、最大堆和频次表；删除元素时用频次表延迟清理堆顶。"
    ],
    "timeLimit": 2,
    "memoryLimit": 262144,
    "outputLimit": 65536,
    "checker": "tokens",
    "languages": [
      "python",
      "go",
      "java",
      "cpp"
    ]
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "来源样例",
      "input": "4\npush 1\npush 2\npush 3\npop 1\n",
      "expectedOutput": "1\n2\n3\n6\n",
      "hidden": false,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "删除至空集",
      "input": "2\npush 5\npop 5\n",
      "expectedOutput": "25\n0\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "重复元素删除一个副本",
      "input": "3\npush 4\npush 4\npop 4\n",
      "expectedOutput": "16\n16\n16\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "重复元素最终清空",
      "input": "4\npush 4\npush 4\npop 4\npop 4\n",
      "expectedOutput": "16\n16\n16\n0\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "最大元素乘积使用 64 位结果",
      "input": "2\npush 1000000000\npush 1000000000\n",
      "expectedOutput": "1000000000000000000\n1000000000000000000\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "最值变化",
      "input": "5\npush 9\npush 2\npush 5\npop 2\npush 1\n",
      "expectedOutput": "81\n18\n18\n45\n9\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "删除最大值后刷新最大堆",
      "input": "4\npush 8\npush 3\npush 5\npop 8\n",
      "expectedOutput": "64\n24\n24\n15\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "删除最小值后刷新最小堆",
      "input": "4\npush 8\npush 3\npush 5\npop 3\n",
      "expectedOutput": "64\n24\n24\n40\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "重复最大值保留一个副本",
      "input": "5\npush 7\npush 7\npush 2\npop 7\npush 4\n",
      "expectedOutput": "49\n49\n14\n14\n14\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "重复最小值保留一个副本",
      "input": "5\npush 7\npush 2\npush 2\npop 2\npush 4\n",
      "expectedOutput": "49\n14\n14\n14\n14\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "交替删除两端",
      "input": "5\npush 1\npush 100\npop 1\npush 2\npop 100\n",
      "expectedOutput": "1\n100\n10000\n200\n4\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "多次从空集合重新开始",
      "input": "5\npush 3\npop 3\npush 9\npop 9\npush 5\n",
      "expectedOutput": "9\n0\n81\n0\n25\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "逐步删除直至空集",
      "input": "6\npush 1\npush 2\npush 3\npop 2\npop 1\npop 3\n",
      "expectedOutput": "1\n2\n3\n3\n9\n0\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "最大值与最小值相乘",
      "input": "3\npush 1000000000\npush 1\npop 1\n",
      "expectedOutput": "1000000000000000000\n1000000000\n1000000000000000000\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "大值重复删除一个副本",
      "input": "4\npush 1\npush 1000000000\npush 1000000000\npop 1000000000\n",
      "expectedOutput": "1\n1000000000\n1000000000\n1000000000\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "三份重复值留下单份",
      "input": "5\npush 6\npush 6\npush 6\npop 6\npop 6\n",
      "expectedOutput": "36\n36\n36\n36\n36\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "删除端点后插入新极值",
      "input": "6\npush 2\npush 9\npush 4\npop 9\npush 8\npop 2\n",
      "expectedOutput": "4\n18\n18\n8\n16\n32\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "两端各有重复值",
      "input": "6\npush 11\npush 5\npush 11\npush 5\npop 11\npop 5\n",
      "expectedOutput": "121\n55\n55\n55\n55\n55\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "堆顶连续惰性清理",
      "input": "7\npush 1\npush 2\npush 3\npush 4\npop 4\npop 3\npush 9\n",
      "expectedOutput": "1\n2\n3\n4\n3\n2\n9\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "连续变更后重建两端",
      "input": "7\npush 4\npush 1\npush 9\npop 1\npop 9\npush 3\npush 7\n",
      "expectedOutput": "16\n4\n9\n36\n16\n12\n21\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "同值重复插入删除再清空",
      "input": "6\npush 13\npush 13\npop 13\npush 13\npop 13\npop 13\n",
      "expectedOutput": "169\n169\n169\n169\n169\n0\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    }
  ]
}
